# Large media — keep video assets out of git. They belong in cloud
# storage (Drive, Mux, S3) and get referenced by URL. GitHub warns
# at 50MB and rejects at 100MB; a single 23MB video sneaked into
# 1cfb746 before this rule existed. Add specific videos back via
# `git add -f` if you actually need one tracked.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.m4v
